WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Ryu recovers while the opponent lies down after light Tatsu.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.150
Ryu prepares heavy Hashogeki after moving in.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.000
The opponent blocks the heavy Hashogeki.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Ryu reaches for a throw after the blocked attack.

5
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.020
The forward throw brings the opponent down.
